* text=auto eol=lf

# Composer installs rushlightlab/kinglet (the PHP SDK) from this repository, and
# GitHub's archive of a tag is what it downloads. Ship only the SDK: the last
# matching line wins, so everything is excluded, then the SDK is let back in.
/* export-ignore
/composer.json -export-ignore
/LICENSE -export-ignore
/packages -export-ignore
/packages/* export-ignore
/packages/sdk-php -export-ignore
/packages/sdk-php/* export-ignore
/packages/sdk-php/src -export-ignore
/packages/sdk-php/README.md -export-ignore
